Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos16
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos16)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos16)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos16).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos16 adds the LCOS 0.9 hardware gap pick-list on frozen lcos15:
 USB net/WWAN/serial, AMD pinctrl and SOF/ACP audio, Type-C
 controllers, tablets and touchscreens, Intel ISH, Wi-Fi/BT
 long-tail, Apple backlight/gmux, Intel NPU, VirtualBox guest,
 VFIO, and vhost_net. Rust left off (No Forced Rust). No firmware
 blob is included. Proprietary NVIDIA is not included.
 .
 LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12; that config stays frozen.
 lcos13, lcos14, and lcos15 stay frozen. This package is the lcos16
 revision of the same linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke name. On earlier LCOS
 releases that still ship a Distro kernel, installing this metapackage
 adds a GRUB entry alongside it.
